rative epidermis: topical application of PPAR<italic>&#x003b1;</italic> activators restores tissue homeostasis</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Investigative Dermatology</italic></source><year>2000</year><volume>115</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>361</fpage><lpage>367</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10951269</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanley</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>K&#x000f6;m&#x000fc;ves</surname><given-names>LG</given-names></name><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Farnesol stimulates differentiation in epidermal keratinocytes via PPAR<italic>&#x003b1;</italic></article-title><source><italic>Journal of Biological Chemistry</italic></source><year>2000</year><volume>275</volume><issue>15</issue><fpage>11484</fpage><lpage>11491</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10753967</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thuillier</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Anchiraico</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Nickel</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Activators of peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor-<italic>&#x003b1;</italic> partially inhibit mouse skin tumor promotion</article-title><source><italic>Molecular Carcinogenesis</italic></source><year>2000</year><volume>29</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>134</fpage><lpage>142</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11108658</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Collett</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name><name><surname>Betts</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</